                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-10231" title="sanity-sec test_27: mgs and default fileset mismatch" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-10231"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-10231&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is closed as dup of  &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-10290" title="sanity-sec test_27: fileset info still not cleared on nodemap" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-10290"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-10290&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; which is landed :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="codeContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre class="code-java"&gt;commit 0dd5215a9e03aae0e01b93e1bd45ab6657af02a9
Author:     Sebastien Buisson &amp;lt;sbuisson@ddn.com&amp;gt;
AuthorDate: Tue Nov 28 10:25:31 2017 +0100
Commit:     Oleg Drokin &amp;lt;oleg.drokin@intel.com&amp;gt;
CommitDate: Thu Jan 25 04:47:29 2018 +0000
    LU-10290 tests: properly set fileset with combined MGT/MDT
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;but we still see the issue on several sanity-sec tests (16-25, 27):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="codeContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre class="code-java"&gt;== sanity-sec test 16: test nodemap all_off fileops ================================================== 16:30:16 (1518885016)
mdt.lustre-MDT0000.identity_upcall=NONE
mdt.lustre-MDT0001.identity_upcall=NONE
..
nodemap.active=0
OTHER - IP: 192.168.112.35

sanity-sec test_16: @@@@@@ FAIL: mgs and active  mismatch, 10 attempts 
..
sanity-sec test_17: @@@@@@ FAIL: mgs and active  mismatch, 10 attempts 
..
sanity-sec test_18: @@@@@@ FAIL: mgs and active  mismatch, 10 attempts
